equencing in microfabricated high-density picolitre reactors</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2005</year><volume>437</volume><fpage>376</fpage><lpage>380</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16056220</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xie</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Allen</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilken</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Carrington</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>DICER-LIKE 4 functions in trans-acting small interfering RNA biogenesis and vegetative phase change in <italic>Arabidopsis thaliana</italic></article-title><source>Proc. Natl Acad. Sci. USA</source><year>2005</year><volume>102</volume><fpage>12984</fpage><lpage>12989</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16129836</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xie</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Johansen</surname><given-names>LK</given-names></name><name><surname>Gustafson</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kasschau</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name><name><surname>Lellis</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name><name><surname>Zilberman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacobsen</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Carrington</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic and functional diversification of small RNA pathways in plants</article-title><source>PLoS Biol.</source><year>2004</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>E104</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15024409</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><pe